<title>NETHERLANDS: RESEARCH - ING reiterates EVC as 'Hold'.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH - ING reiterates EVC as 'Hold'.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of March 5 research.</p>
<p>Company--------------- Sector--------Price---Broker---------</p>
<p>EVC International	Chemicals     53.50   ING Barings</p>
<p>COMMENT: Hold (unchanged). Full-year results before extraordinaries at break-even point thanks to cost savings. Cost savings seen remaining major part of EVC strategy given meagre outlook for PVC market. European PVC market in 1997 seen comparable to last year, with demand rising by about two pct, but imports could reappear. Low cash margins will put lid on earnings growth. 1998 cash margins seen improving to DM 770 per tonne, while volumes to increase by another three percent.</p>
<p>    Estimates (NLG):  EPS     pvs EPS   P/E    Dividend</p>
<p>    1996 (actual)     -0.01   -0.01     --     3.00</p>
<p>    1997		   6.84    7.00     7.8    3.00</p>
<p>    1998		   9.85   10.31     5.4    3.00</p>
